	'messages:config-db-ssl' => 'io:Konektar per SSL',
	'messages:config-db-schema' => 'io:Skemo por MediaWiki (sen strekteti):',
	'messages:config-db-schema-help' => 'io:Ca \'\'schema\'\' por datumaro certe funcionos.
Modifikez ol NUR se vu FAKTE bezonos modifikar ol.',
	'messages:config-pg-test-error' => 'io:Ne povis konektar a la datumaro <strong>$1</strong>: $2',
	'messages:config-sqlite-dir' => 'io:SQLite data directory:',
	'messages:config-sqlite-dir-help' => 'io:SQLite stores all data in a single file.

The directory you provide must be writable by the webserver during installation.

It should <strong>not</strong> be accessible via the web; this is why we\'re not putting it where your PHP files are.

The installer will write a <code>.htaccess</code> file along with it, but if that fails someone can gain access to your raw database.
That includes raw user data (email addresses, hashed passwords) as well as deleted revisions and other restricted data on the wiki.

Consider putting the database somewhere else altogether, for example in <code>/var/lib/mediawiki/yourwiki</code>.',
	'messages:config-type-mysql' => 'io:MariaDB, MySQL, o konciliebla',
	'messages:config-support-info' => 'io:MediaWiki suportas la sequanta sistemi pri dati (\'\'database systems\'\':)

$1

Se vu ne vidis la sistemo pri dati quon vu deziras uzar, voluntez sequar la sequanta instrukturi, por recevar suporto.',
	'messages:config-dbsupport-mysql' => 'io:* [{{int:version-db-mariadb-url}} MariaDB] is the primary target for MediaWiki and is best supported. MediaWiki also works with [{{int:version-db-mysql-url}} MySQL] and [{{int:version-db-percona-url}} Percona Server], which are MariaDB compatible. ([https://www.php.net/manual/en/mysqli.installation.php How to compile PHP with MySQL support])',
	'messages:config-dbsupport-postgres' => 'io:* [{{int:version-db-postgres-url}} PostgreSQL] is a popular open source database system as an alternative to MySQL. ([https://www.php.net/manual/en/pgsql.installation.php How to compile PHP with PostgreSQL support])',
	'messages:config-dbsupport-sqlite' => 'io:* La lejera datumaro-sistemo [{{int:version-db-sqlite-url}} SQLite] esas tre efikiva cakaze. ([https://www.php.net/manual/en/pdo.installation.php Quale kompilar PHP kun suporto a SQLite], uzas PDO)',
